WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.268
"Morb took them!" Perda hissed into Zann's ear. "He took the king and queen!"

2
00:00:06.269 --> 00:00:13.654
"Yeah." Zann held on to the bars at the end of the tunnel and peered into the room inside the palace. "I saw."

3
00:00:13.655 --> 00:00:18.269
Zann didn't know what to think. He'd been counting on the king and queen to help them.

4
00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:22.322
Now they were gone. Just like his parents. Just like Boz.

5
00:00:22.323 --> 00:00:26.242
"Look," Darb said. "Everyone's waking up."

6
00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:28.427
The people in the room were stirring.

7
00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:35.375
A woman with sleek, dark hair sat up, looking confused. "Your Majesties?" she called out.

8
00:00:35.376 --> 00:00:38.249
A man who had been frozen shook off the spell.

9
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:43.705
He was tall, broad-shouldered, and young, with a friendly face and spiky blond hair.

10
00:00:43.706 --> 00:00:47.001
"The king and queen are gone," he said hoarsely.

11
00:00:47.002 --> 00:00:51.727
"I saw it happen. A man zapped in with a bunch of trolls and took them."

12
00:00:51.728 --> 00:00:53.987
"What man?" the woman asked.

13
00:00:53.988 --> 00:00:57.038
"His name is Morb!" Perda called out.

14
00:00:57.039 --> 00:01:00.957
The man and woman spun around. "Who said that?" the man asked.

15
00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:03.430
"We're in here," Zann called.

16
00:01:03.431 --> 00:01:07.079
By now most of the other people in the room were awake too.

17
00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:11.174
A man with a pale, narrow face looked down sharply.

18
00:01:11.175 --> 00:01:18.547
"Rixa, Yog! Don't go over there!" he said with a suspicious frown. "It could be a trap."

19
00:01:18.548 --> 00:01:22.495
"It's not a trap," Gliss said. "We're just kids.

20
00:01:22.496 --> 00:01:24.751
Please let us out of this tunnel."

21
00:01:24.752 --> 00:01:28.625
"Can't you zap yourselves out?" the woman, Rixa, asked.

22
00:01:28.626 --> 00:01:32.385
"We can't use magic right now," Zann said.

23
00:01:32.386 --> 00:01:38.475
"If you let us out, we'll explain everything, including who took the king and queen."

24
00:01:38.476 --> 00:01:42.065
"How would you know that?" the pale man retorted.

25
00:01:42.066 --> 00:01:46.900
"Relax, Slib," the young man, Yog, said. "Let's hear what they have to say."

26
00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:50.055
He snapped his fingers and the bars melted away.

27
00:01:50.056 --> 00:01:54.843
Zing was so relieved to be out of the tunnel that he flew around whistling.

28
00:01:54.844 --> 00:02:00.287
"Thanks," Zann said. "We were trying to reach the king and queen so we could—"

29
00:02:00.288 --> 00:02:09.633
"Hold on, young man," Slib interrupted. He rubbed his hands together and then pointed at the kids. "Reveal," he intoned.

30
00:02:09.634 --> 00:02:14.446
Zann felt a spark run through him, and Gliss let out a squeak of surprise.

31
00:02:14.447 --> 00:02:18.059
Suddenly their red hair and freckles were visible again!

32
00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:26.202
The adults murmured in amazement. "You're Reds!" Rixa exclaimed. "How have you escaped the trolls?"

33
00:02:26.203 --> 00:02:29.681
"That's not important." Zann pulled out the diary.

34
00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:32.715
"We need to show you what's in this diary.

35
00:02:32.716 --> 00:02:38.395
It belongs to my grandfather, Boz. He's a retired Magic Master, and—"

36
00:02:38.396 --> 00:02:44.090
"Boz?" an older man interrupted. "Did you say Boz is your grandfather?"

37
00:02:44.091 --> 00:02:47.535
Suddenly everyone in the room was staring at Zann.

38
00:02:47.536 --> 00:02:51.382
"Um, yeah," he said. "Do you know him?"

39
00:02:51.383 --> 00:02:59.273
Rixa chuckled. "We all know Boz. He was one of the finest advisers ever to serve at the palace.

40
00:02:59.274 --> 00:03:03.160
When the last queen retired, the current king and queen begged him to stay.

41
00:03:03.161 --> 00:03:06.115
But Boz wanted to spend more time with his family."

42
00:03:06.116 --> 00:03:11.551
"Boz worked at the palace?" Perda glanced at Zann. "You never told me that."

43
00:03:11.552 --> 00:03:16.065
"I didn't know." Zann could hardly believe his ears.

44
00:03:16.066 --> 00:03:19.976
He knew that his grandfather had once been a powerful Magic Master.

45
00:03:19.977 --> 00:03:23.722
But Boz had never mentioned that he'd also been a royal adviser.

46
00:03:23.723 --> 00:03:26.344
Zann didn't have much time to think about it though.

47
00:03:26.345 --> 00:03:29.471
Almost everyone was rushing over to ask him questions.

48
00:03:29.472 --> 00:03:37.289
Zann introduced himself and his friends, explained how Boz had been taken, and started to tell the adults about Morb.

49
00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.835
"I've heard enough," Slib interrupted after a few minutes.

50
00:03:40.836 --> 00:03:48.826
"This Morb fellow sounds dangerous. We need to decide who's going to take over until the king and queen return."

51
00:03:48.827 --> 00:03:52.422
Rixa looked uneasy. "Let's not be hasty."

52
00:03:52.423 --> 00:03:57.271
"I won't sit here and wait for something even worse to happen," Slib said.

53
00:03:57.272 --> 00:04:01.176
"We must protect the citizens of Magica."

54
00:04:01.177 --> 00:04:06.211
"Boz seemed to think there might be answers in here." Zann held up the diary again.

55
00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:12.048
Slib grabbed it. "Fine. Now come along, children. I'll show you out."

56
00:04:12.049 --> 00:04:16.170
"No!" Yog looked alarmed. "They won't be safe on the streets."

57
00:04:16.171 --> 00:04:20.890
"He's right," another man said. "Boz would want us to protect them."

58
00:04:20.891 --> 00:04:25.046
"Besides, we haven't told you everything we know," Perda put in.

59
00:04:25.047 --> 00:04:28.256
"We've seen Morb a bunch of times and—"

60
00:04:28.257 --> 00:04:33.148
"Yes, yes." Slib sounded impatient. "Come with me then.

61
00:04:33.149 --> 00:04:36.630
We'll go somewhere more private to discuss it."

62
00:04:36.631 --> 00:04:39.540
"Good idea," Yog said. "I'll come too.

63
00:04:39.541 --> 00:04:43.630
I'd like to talk more with Boz's grandson." He smiled at Zann.

64
00:04:43.631 --> 00:04:47.635
"I was only a boy when Boz was here, but he was always kind to me."

65
00:04:47.636 --> 00:04:55.902
Rixa nodded. "I'll come as well. I know the perfect spot for such a conversation. Follow me."

66
00:04:55.903 --> 00:05:03.889
Slib looked annoyed. "Where are we going?" he asked as Rixa led him, the kids, and Yog down a hallway.

67
00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:06.647
Zing flew along just above Zann's head.

68
00:05:06.648 --> 00:05:14.772
"You'll see—we're almost there." Rixa led the way into a large sitting room, filled with fancy decorations and exotic furniture.

69
00:05:14.773 --> 00:05:19.452
Two doors on the far side of the room opened into equally luxurious bedrooms.

70
00:05:19.453 --> 00:05:23.031
"Wow, this place is nice!" said Gliss.

71
00:05:23.032 --> 00:05:28.276
"Please relax, kids," Rixa said. "You'll be safe here while we figure out what to do."

72
00:05:28.277 --> 00:05:36.187
For a moment Zann didn't understand. Then he noticed Rixa and Yog backing out of the room, pulling Slib along with them.

73
00:05:36.188 --> 00:05:39.319
"Wait!" Perda said. "Where are you going?"

74
00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:42.544
"This is for your own protection," Rixa said.

75
00:05:42.545 --> 00:05:47.189
"No!" Zann protested. "You can't shut us in here!"

76
00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:51.767
Yog smiled kindly. "Please don't try to use magic to get out.

77
00:05:51.768 --> 00:05:54.186
You already told us it's not safe for you."

78
00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:59.247
"Besides, this suite is protected by extra-strong Shield spells," Rixa added.

79
00:05:59.248 --> 00:06:02.449
"Nobody can zap in or out without knowing the password."

80
00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:04.614
"Wait!" cried Zann.

81
00:06:04.615 --> 00:06:13.742
But the door had already slammed shut.

